# This file should contain a certificate and private key for CMS demo signer 2.
# 
# SECURITY NOTICE:
# Private keys should NOT be committed to version control repositories.
# 
# To generate this file, run:
#   ./setup.sh
# 
# This will create test certificates and keys that can be used with the
# CMS demonstration programs. The generated file will contain:
# - A certificate (public)
# - An RSA private key (PRIVATE - keep secure)
#
# For reference, the original test certificate that was here had:
#   Subject: C=UK, CN=OpenSSL test S/MIME signer 2, emailAddress=test2@openssl.org
#   Issuer: C=UK, L=Test City, O=OpenSSL Group, CN=Test S/MIME Root CA
#
# DO NOT use this file in production. These are for testing/demonstration only.
